    "viz_footer": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "Edge metrics come from the `_metrics` index (`processor_events_in_total` and related counters, macro `exec_health_edge_mstats`); grant the viewing role access to `_metrics` on Splunk Cloud. If those panels are empty or error, Edge Processor is not writing metrics to this stack \u2014 use `_internal` logs instead. **Filter efficiency** = `(events_in - events_out) / events_in`. High values mean pipelines are dropping or routing away from indexers. SC4S error scans use macro `exec_health_sc4s_idx` (default `*`). Narrow it on Cloud to avoid expensive `index=*` event searches.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
